    "detailed_description": "<i>In Your Books</i> tells the story of a young woman going on a week long holiday at her grandmother's. As she arrives it seems that the old bookseller has disappeared, leaving the local bookshop closed indefinitely.<br><br>Take her place to assist the locals. By learning more about them you might uncover where your grandma has gone.<br><br>In addition with the tasks that awaits you at the bookshop, solve the mechanisms of a mysterious cabinet each evening to reveal some of her secrets.<br><br>---<br><br><i>In Your Books</i> is a short game (less than an hour long), a slice of life shrouded in mystery.<br><br>---<br><br>The evocative, ambient original score and beautiful digitally painted visuals support a short story blending feelings, realism and reflection.",
    "about_the_game": "<i>In Your Books</i> tells the story of a young woman going on a week long holiday at her grandmother's. As she arrives it seems that the old bookseller has disappeared, leaving the local bookshop closed indefinitely.<br><br>Take her place to assist the locals. By learning more about them you might uncover where your grandma has gone.<br><br>In addition with the tasks that awaits you at the bookshop, solve the mechanisms of a mysterious cabinet each evening to reveal some of her secrets.<br><br>---<br><br><i>In Your Books</i> is a short game (less than an hour long), a slice of life shrouded in mystery.<br><br>---<br><br>The evocative, ambient original score and beautiful digitally painted visuals support a short story blending feelings, realism and reflection.",
    "short_description": "In Your Books is a short adventure game where you play the granddaughter of a bookseller. After her disappearance you'll have to take the place of your grandmother. Recommend books, learn to know the locals, solve secret mechanisms and discover where she left.",
